OL,3,GNEWSABody still missing after four     
OL,4,Aconvictions                            
OL,6,FFour men are due to be sentenced next  
OL,7,Fmonth for offences linked to the       
OL,8,Fkidnapping of a man who was tortured   
OL,9,Fand murdered more than eight years ago.
OL,11,FJohnny Robbins, 33, disappeared in     
OL,12,FMarch 2018 and his body has never been 
OL,13,Ffound.                                 
OL,15,FHis death is linked to the murder of   
OL,16,FDaniel Shaw, who was found with gunshot
OL,17,Finjuries to his chest in Copland Place,
OL,18,FTile Hill, on 25 March 2018, police    
OL,19,Fsaid.                                  
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
